  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n (2)/(3) × (6)/(5) × (10)/(4) + (1)/(8) - (3)/(8)\n\nFormula Used:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/eafd54de9d9fc295c072d1fa0b8367ee3ed24189b7ad133a51c29266134693c4.png] \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ (2)/(3) × (6)/(5) × (10)/(4) + (1)/(8) - (3)/(8)\n\n**⇒ **(2)/(1) × (2)/(5) × (5)/(2) + (1)/(8) - (3)/(8)\n\n⇒ 2 + (1)/(8) - (3)/(8)\n\n⇒ (16+1-3)/(8)\n\n⇒ (17-3)/(8)\n\n⇒ (14)/(8)\n\n⇒ (7)/(4)\n\n∴ **The Correct Answer is (7)/(4)**",
